### Create product
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Keyboard",
  "description": "Mechanical keyboard",
  "price": 79.99,
  "quantity": 10
}

### Get all products
GET http://localhost:8080/products

### Receive stock
POST http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/products/1/receive
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 5
}